### :returns: The correctly rounded result.
@rf("BF16.exp2_unchecked")
routine BF16.exp2_unchecked() -> BF16

### Returns 2 raised to this value, correctly rounded. Checked: crashes when the result isn't finite. Use `exp2_unchecked` for raw IEEE 754 results.
