### :returns: The correctly rounded result.
@rf("BF16.exp2m1_unchecked")
routine BF16.exp2m1_unchecked() -> BF16

### Returns 2 raised to this value, minus 1 (accurate near 0), correctly rounded. Checked: crashes when the result isn't finite. Use `exp2m1_unchecked` for raw IEEE 754 results.
### :returns: The result.
### :throws: {NumericDomainError} when there is no real result.
### :throws: {NumericOverflowError} when the result is out of range.
@rf("BF16.exp2m1")
failable routine BF16.exp2m1() -> BF16

### Returns 10 raised to this value, minus 1 (accurate near 0) with raw IEEE 754 results (a pole, overflow or a value outside the domain passes
### through as ±infinity or NaN), correctly rounded to BF16.
### :returns: The correctly rounded result.
@rf("BF16.exp10m1_unchecked")
routine BF16.exp10m1_unchecked() -> BF16

### Returns 10 raised to this value, minus 1 (accurate near 0), correctly rounded. Checked: crashes when the result isn't finite. Use `exp10m1_unchecked` for raw IEEE 754 results.
### :returns: The result.
### :throws: {NumericDomainError} when there is no real result.
### :throws: {NumericOverflowError} when the result is out of range.
@rf("BF16.exp10m1")
failable routine BF16.exp10m1() -> BF16

### Returns the natural logarithm with raw IEEE 754 results (a pole, overflow or a value outside the domain passes
