### :returns: The correctly rounded result.
@rf("BF16.log_unchecked")
routine BF16.log_unchecked() -> BF16

### Returns the natural logarithm, correctly rounded. Checked: crashes when the result isn't finite. Use `log_unchecked` for raw IEEE 754 results.
